B.bjX=new A.e9("How do I pay my rent?",'Elevo does not collect rent. On your home screen, under Rent, you will see the payment instructions your own landlord entered (Zelle, Venmo, bank transfer, check, or cash). Pay them directly, then tap "I Have Paid" so your landlord can confirm it.')
B.bk2=new A.e9("Where can I see my payment history?","Your confirmed payments appear in the payment history section on your home screen. Each entry shows the date, amount, and payment method. Your landlord confirms payments after receiving them \u2014 pending payments show until confirmed.")
B.bjZ=new A.e9("What happens if I pay late?","Late fees are between you and your landlord. Elevo does not add a late-fee line to the rent screen. Message your landlord if you have a question about a late payment.")
B.aWU=s([B.bjX,B.bk2,B.bjZ],t.zX)
B.bjM=new A.hK("My Rent",B.es,B.aWU)
B.bkk=new A.e9("How do I submit a maintenance request?",'Tap the Maintenance tab at the bottom of the screen, then tap "Submit New Request." Describe the issue, select a category and priority level, and optionally add up to 5 photos. Tap Submit \u2014 your landlord will be notified immediately.')
B.bkm=new A.e9("What priority should I choose for my request?","Low: cosmetic or non-urgent issues that can wait weeks. Medium: issues affecting comfort but not safety (e.g., appliance not working). High: issues significantly affecting habitability (e.g., major leak, AC failure in summer). Emergency: immediate safety threats (e.g., gas leak, flooding, no heat in winter). Elevo does not send text messages. Contact your landlord directly in an emergency.")
B.bk7=new A.e9("How do I track the status of my request?","Each request shows a 4-stage progress bar: Submitted \u2192 Assigned \u2192 In Progress \u2192 Resolved. Tap any request to see full details including landlord notes and assigned vendor name. You'll receive a push notification whenever your landlord updates the status.")
B.aK9=s([B.bkk,B.bkm,B.bk7],t.zX)
B.bjQ=new A.hK("Maintenance Requests",B.dR,B.aK9)
B.bkg=new A.e9("Where can I find my lease agreement?","Go to More \u2192 Documents. Your lease agreement and other documents shared by your landlord appear here. Tap any document to preview or download it. You can filter by document type using the chips at the top.")
B.bkc=new A.e9("How do I know when my lease expires?","Your home screen shows a lease countdown card with a circular progress indicator, your lease end date, and the exact number of days remaining. Your landlord will also send reminders at 90, 60, and 30 days before expiration (if enabled).")
B.aS_=s([B.bkg,B.bkc],t.zX)
B.bjO=new A.hK("Documents & Lease",B.dp,B.aS_)
B.bkb=new A.e9("How do I message my landlord?","Tap the Messages tab at the bottom of the screen to open a direct conversation with your landlord. You can send text messages and attach photos or files. You'll receive a push notification when your landlord replies.")
B.bka=new A.e9("Can my landlord see all my messages?","Messages between you and your landlord are private to your conversation. No other tenants can see your messages. Elevo stores messages securely in Supabase with row-level security policies ensuring only you and your landlord can access your conversation.")
B.aK2=s([B.bkb,B.bka],t.zX)
B.bjS=new A.hK("Messages",B.fS,B.aK2)
